{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "67468a85d97107907bd4c68e1a065986fbe33567cf2b5621e822e66c069e3dc0", "ja": "（39プロジェクトのスタートに合わせて、\n響の宣材写真も新しく撮り直すことになった）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，\n响的宣传照也要重拍。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8788c06c49cf0fa4320cb85dfc4f5092f873fa4f0be26a381b80432f722374d9", "ja": "（とはいえ響にとっては、1度通った道。その天性の\n魅力と今までの経験で、完璧に撮影を終わらせた！）", "zh": "（话虽如此，这对响而言已经是走过一次的道路，\n她用天生的魅力和之前的经验，完美地拍完了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "b7c67cf264ff4b7fb28922f8c829a0c891c447deed052793caf658d7f87e2ad4", "ja": "へへーん！　どう、{$P$}？\n自分、カンペキな撮影だったでしょ！", "zh": "嘿嘿～！怎么样啊，{$P$}？\n本人拍得很完美吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b58d4bafbc32a5c492a4f13ff2e8251a0a27c60873fa5ee362e03f33e7dc610c", "ja": "ああ。いい写真がたくさん撮れたよ。正直、この中から\n1枚を決めるとなると、なかなか大変そうだ。", "zh": "是呀，拍到很多好照片喔。说实在的，\n要从这里面选一张出来，感觉真的很难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "2383ac16c501fc8bfabc8b022a7bed150b02d8b224dca40fd6b51a5e57b1b44d", "ja": "えへへ♪　まあ、自分は天才だからね！\nこれくらいは当たり前さ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪毕竟本人是天才啊！\n这点程度没什么啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "b20441d2f8dce1d85a983aa8c1c688ccb1995e6fcf7842821b323971767bab00", "ja": "{$P$}！　悩みに悩んで、\nカンペキな自分の、カンペキな1枚を選んでよね！", "zh": "{$P$}！请用心思考，\n帮完美本人选出一张完美照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8968ed16c6e932faa963d1186fd5782d0833bd1caba840ec4fe65254cfcef50a", "ja": "ああ、そこは任せてくれ。\n……っと、そろそろ次の撮影が始まるな。", "zh": "嗯，这就交给我吧。\n……话说，下一场拍摄差不多要开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "622ab081f33dfcceaf56c443ed2662d5df8b5f4f8a684bea1d2a9035d283bd42", "ja": "響は、別の現場で仕事があったよな。お疲れさま。\nもうそっちに行ってくれて構わないぞ。頑張れよ！", "zh": "响在其他地点还有工作吧？辛苦你了。\n你可以先过去了，加油啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "8b5545bfa6312ce582133c196663a523524c22c457ac3a437139faf15d55b062", "ja": "え？　自分の仕事はこれで終わりじゃないぞ？\nむしろ、ここからが本番さー！", "zh": "咦？本人的工作现在还没结束喔！\n接下来才是最重要的部分啦──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1009_p", "source_sha256": "efd35b82ebddfe7f9aabaaf21d1f2ad9a6805acb48489cb3d001eac0c6ad7235", "ja": "ここから本番……？\nどういうことだ？", "zh": "接下来才是最重要的部分……？\n什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "8fac25c6698087afe86faea3ce1e508d63166460d24f02b56e9affcb562ea22d", "ja": "このあと、後輩のみんなの撮影なんでしょ？\n自分もその撮影に立ち会うつもりなんだっ。", "zh": "等一下是换后辈们拍照对吧？\n本人打算在旁边看大家拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8e850adeb4dd4ded72fc0df95190cf631cb3914acb1b24334b08b84187088aa9", "ja": "そ、そうなのか？\n俺は初耳だけど……どうしてまた？", "zh": "是、是这样吗？\n我没听你说过……为什么要这么做？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "1e89fe8690c6415a88336fddd48ba4ed78bb03eaa41c0130fdca4bda87851d08", "ja": "先輩なんだから、これくらい当たり前だぞ。\n自分も初めての撮影の時は、すっごく緊張したし。", "zh": "因为本人是前辈，这点程度没什么啦。\n毕竟本人第一次拍摄时也超紧张的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "22bf5476327517ed645bf65e7fda7c093ec0b16947a4d49961dff423c7a15ff3", "ja": "だから自分がお手本になって、\nみんなを安心させてあげなくちゃ！", "zh": "所以本人得当个好榜样，\n让大家安心才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "19c125c55b857c3ad645ece2af57516e4c174cbc9696721b80b5af461cfb6914", "ja": "だって、宣材写真って、これからのみんなの\n顔みたいな、大事なモノなんでしょ？", "zh": "因为宣传照就像大家今后的脸孔一样，\n非常重要吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "75d968163b6a6d0645c689634a7b68c75606af1dbedb8c94491a7eb8cf5c7b64", "ja": "だったら、少しでもいいモノを撮ってあげないと\nダメだぞ、{$P$}！", "zh": "既然如此，就得拍好一点才行喔，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "615a6c006890cf63855069d562ed93ae1bd3ad152631c4c71a3aa14425c7ee2c", "ja": "響、そんなことを……。", "zh": "响，原来你是这么想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_1017", "source_sha256": "c63333b3c63f776fa9952e62a2733f278ab6d1c8c8183600ccbb9a33e371acc2", "ja": "すっかり先輩だな！", "zh": "很有前辈的样子呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2000_p", "source_sha256": "721892edb14522762de864e6b1e73f345654937c3d7f5e33f02917c4c04636b6", "ja": "もう、すっかり先輩だな。感心したよ！", "zh": "你很有前辈的样子呢，我很佩服你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2001_013hib", "source_sha256": "26d65e85d34f8456464d6a58f43cf73edbe4563abdbdba2494a4fc5c2b624cd0", "ja": "えへへっ、このぐらい当たり前さー。\nこれからみんなと家族になるんだからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，这也是应该的啦──\n因为今后要和大家成为家人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2002_013hib", "source_sha256": "3ade35080f23cb64aba813cd0a0a89ab6d1279aea656ca3e0967a1a3b03c7628", "ja": "そういうわけで、{$P$}、この後の\n撮影順を教えて！　自分がバリバリ指導してあげるぞ！", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}，告诉本人\n接下来的拍照顺序吧！本人会好好指导大家的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2003_p", "source_sha256": "371034f406dbab5daf82712b00ade36c4e196643b4c1ede15c67ed669f7b22a5", "ja": "ああ、そうしてくれ！　……と言いたいところだけど、\n残念ながら、響には次の仕事がある。", "zh": "虽然我也想回答「那就交给你了！」……\n但很可惜，响接下来还有其他工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "4842254f61434544e89214a55d7f72e25bfb6ce3312e13457fac7d4b169f2287", "ja": "全員分の指導をしてたら、遅刻してしまうぞ？\n先輩がそんなことでいいのか？", "zh": "如果指导了所有人，你就会迟到喔。\n作为前辈这样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2005_013hib", "source_sha256": "a93f452a555dd4000b3e09699c65c7509883f396b2b0d43a01cc5aa731a1be95", "ja": "そ、それはそうだけど……。\nでも、みんなにはいい写真を撮ってもらいたいし……！", "zh": "是、是没错啦……\n可是，本人又希望大家都能拍出好照片……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2006_013hib", "source_sha256": "02bfd6ccde65122d6a1e035a625fca73f91bcc52e80d1e3930f8f741fe047bdd", "ja": "う、ううっ……そ、それじゃあ！\n自分の代わりによろしくね、いぬ美！", "zh": "呜、呜呜……那、那么！\n就拜托你来代替本人了，汪美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2007_inumi", "source_sha256": "e6235ac3b13a6366b6dd04207e56c53977d846682e94522ff17630704c09ced9", "ja": "バウッ！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2008_p", "source_sha256": "90141dc098811e3c9dd03829517e443746323a18bed85bc47f5b422ee1aa8edb", "ja": "うわ、いつの間に！\n……というか、さすがにいぬ美に指導はムリだろ？", "zh": "哇，什么时候来的！\n重点是……汪美应该没办法指导人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2009_p", "source_sha256": "61c4ed64995e17689198f877fa63bb662d92460d8da145328764c58b0c5bd72d", "ja": "大丈夫、安心してくれ。\n響の分もきっちり、俺がみんなをフォローするから。", "zh": "不过你放心，\n我会连同响的份一起好好支援大家的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2010_013hib", "source_sha256": "019acbfbcd43274f18931c796ff10817d1a88660b11f210cf3a0cf8acf6fd995", "ja": "うう……。約束だぞ、{$P$}。\nちゃんとカンペキな写真を撮ってあげてねっ！", "zh": "呜呜……约好了喔，{$P$}。\n你要确实帮她们拍出完美照片喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2011_p", "source_sha256": "2f44e878e5acfc34fa119a9b37199718ba832fd68e4cda483813bb9819f2aa44", "ja": "ああ、今撮った響の写真よりも\nカンペキなものを撮ってみせる！", "zh": "嗯，我会让大家拍出比响刚才拍的宣传照\n更完美的照片！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2012_013hib", "source_sha256": "aa5c018cea81715a51c2194bcf198d84e85f8011983a425a2dec23a468134568", "ja": "えっ……な、なんかそれはずるいぞ～！？\nだったら自分も、もっとカンペキなのを撮ってよ～！", "zh": "咦……那、那样也太狡猾了吧～！？\n既然如此，也帮本人拍得更完美一点嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_013hib_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_013hib_002_2013_p", "source_sha256": "2f320ae1f53eb41b3a1ac94835f5ef0174c3ffc4b3890479233a4243c2297bdb", "ja": "（家族で仲間でお手本で……そしてライバル。響は\nきっとこれから後輩といい関係を築いてくれるはずだ）", "zh": "（是家人、伙伴兼好榜样……同时也是竞争对手。\n我想今后，响一定能和后辈建立起良好的关系。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
